profiles

List browser profiles available for new task spaces.

await profiles()

listTaskSpaces

List Agent-owned and user-owned spaces available to reuse or claim.

await listTaskSpaces()

taskSpace

Reuse or create an Agent-owned task space; a name held by a user-owned space fails with WIEK_TASK_SPACE_NAME_IN_USE. A new space starts with managed Page p1, and profileId applies only when creating it. Options: profileId: Browser profile id returned by profiles(); new spaces only.

await taskSpace(nameOrId, { profileId? })

claimTaskSpace

Claim a user-owned or inactive space after user approval and return TaskSpace.

await claimTaskSpace(spaceId)

takeOverTaskSpace

Resume an Agent-owned space after user approval and return TaskSpace.

await takeOverTaskSpace(spaceId)

