Page.goto

Navigate this Page in place. Timeout errors report whether the new document committed, plus its URL and readyState when available. Options: referer: HTTP Referer header for the navigation. timeout: Maximum duration in milliseconds. waitUntil (commit | domcontentloaded | load | networkidle): Completion state; defaults to load. networkidle requires 500ms without network activity.

