Return a semantic snapshot of the current viewport, full Page, or one snapshot-ref subtree with Page provenance. Options: scope (full_page | only_within_viewport | subtree): Snapshot scope; defaults to only_within_viewport, including visible iframe content returned by the browser. Use subtree with an iframe root ref to focus on that frame. root: Valid Page snapshot ref such as @21; required only when scope is subtree. Partial snapshots preserve existing node identities. includeActionMarks: Include action marks. includeStableLocator: Include stable locators.

